{"step_index":9592,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-25T12:30:51Z","thinking":"`pypdfium2` is identified as a PDF rendering engine built into Google Chrome's PDFium. This engine promises speed, standalone operation (no external dependencies), and high-quality image output for PDF conversion. It is already installed within the current conda environment.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Test pypdfium2 rendering quality and size","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"import pypdfium2 as pdfium\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport time\nimport os\n\npdf_path = Path(r\"D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\data\\processes\\PROC-015\\input_warehouses\\المكرومي المنصورة.pdf\")\npdf = pdfium.PdfDocument(pdf_path)\nprint(f\"Loaded {pdf_path.name}: {len(pdf)} pages\")\n\nt0 = time.time()\npage = pdf[0] # Page 1\n\n# Render at 2x scale (~144 dpi) and 2.5x scale (~180 dpi)\nfor scale in [2.0, 2.5]:\n    image = page.render(scale=scale).to_pil()\n    \n    # Save as JPEG with quality 85\n    jpg_path = Path(f\"C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/scratch/test_page1_scale{scale}.jpg\")\n    image.save(jpg_path, format=\"JPEG\", quality=85, optimize=True)\n    jpg_size_kb = os.path.getsize(jpg_path) / 1024\n    \n    # Save as WebP with quality 85\n    webp_path = Path(f\"C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/scratch/test_page1_scale{scale}.webp\")\n    image.save(webp_path, format=\"WEBP\", quality=85)\n    webp_size_kb = os.path.getsize(webp_path) / 1024\n    \n    print(f\"Scale {scale}x ({image.width}x{image.height}): JPEG={jpg_size_kb:.1f} KB | WebP={webp_size_kb:.1f} KB\")\n\nt1 = time.time()\nprint(f\"Rendering took: {t1 - t0:.2f}s\")\n","Description":"Test pypdfium2 rendering quality and size","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/scratch/test_pdfium_render.py","toolAction":"Writing file","toolSummary":"Write test_pdfium_render.py"}}]}
